# FBP: Pipeline to process and display sorted word counts
# Demonstrates chaining of components in a flow-based network

'words.txt' -> FILE Read(ReadFile)
Read() OUT -> IN Tokenize(SplitStr)
Tokenize() OUT -> IN Lower(LowerCase)
Lower() OUT -> IN Count(Counter)
Count() OUT -> IN Sort(Sort)
Sort() OUT -> IN Format(Format)
Format() OUT -> IN Display(Output)